(
    title: "Combat",
    developer: Some("Ron Milner, Steve Mayer, Joe Decuir, Larry Wagner"),
    description: Some("Two players duel for two minutes and sixteen seconds, scoring by hitting each other. Console switches choose between tanks seen from above, biplanes seen from the side, and jets, with variations adding maze walls, ricocheting shots, invisible tanks or clouds to hide in. There is no computer opponent — it is a two-player game only."),
